    "description": "This well-maintained 3,650-square-foot, 4-unit apartment building in San Francisco's Western Addition offers strong investment potential. Each of the four apartments is a spacious 5-room layout with formal living and dining rooms. Amenities include on-site laundry, a bike room, and two parking spaces (one vacant)--plus a private rear yard. The property sits one block from the Fillmore commercial corridor and near City Hall and Japantown, close to the new Trader Joe's and a planned mixed-use development. With strong in-place rents, excellent transit connectivity, and a rapidly transforming neighborhood, this asset offers an exceptional long-term investment opportunity."
